# rust
/target/
# Every run cargo-mutants leaves behind, whatever it is called. It rotates
# mutants.out to mutants.out.old itself, and a seat keeping a third run
# names it by hand — so the glob is what makes the next invented name safe.
/mutants.out*/

# nix
result
result-*
.direnv/

# beads: the maintainers' tracker is not part of this repository. Contributors
# file GitHub issues instead; see CLAUDE.md. This entry is tracked rather than
# left to .git/info/exclude so it travels with the clone — `cargo publish`
# uploads the git-tracked tree from a maintainer's machine, and that is exactly
# the machine with a populated .beads/.
/.beads/

# Maintainer-local: credentials, the tracker-aware shell selection, and the
# notes that go with them. Never leave the machine.
.env.local
.envrc.local
CLAUDE.local.md
.beads-credential-key

# Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db

# A seat's worktree is a checkout of this repository, not a source file.
.claude/worktrees/
